# App-written project marker: dev-server logs and worktree state.
.mosaico/

# Logs
*.log
npm-debug.log*
yarn-debug.log*
yarn-error.log*
pnpm-debug.log*

# Local backups, dumps, databases, and private credentials. Review exceptions
# before tracking intentionally public fixtures.
